            "text": "的确 confirms that a proposition is genuinely true. It reinforces a factual judgment rather than introducing a guess.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这本书的确很好。",
                "pinyin": "zhè běn shū díquè hěn hǎo 。",
                "meaning": "This book really is good.",
                "audio": "45937fa25ce8f29533b69c424d10bc66c72cd8d25106f2db409cc3cb786ab31d"
              },
              {
                "text": "他的确来过。",
                "pinyin": "tā díquè lái guo 。",
                "meaning": "He really has been here before.",
